- **Feature Envy / Data Clumps / Repeated Switches / Shotgun Surgery / Divergent Change / Speculative Generality / Message Chains / Middle Man / Refused Bequest** — Not applicable; this is a single declarative CSS rule with no logic, no coupling, and no unused generality.

